5,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,"Since we're all going regardless, let's focus on finding a balance that keeps everyone comfortable. I think we should prioritize understanding the living arrangements and how our time is actually spent. What do you all think?","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"That sounds like a lovely way to start, Mizuki. I agree that comfort is key. I also think it would be helpful to be very clear about the costs so that everything is fair for everyone.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Minato,,I agree with both of you. I wonder if we can also find out about the bathrooms and when we have to eat? I think those things are important for feeling relaxed.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I agree. I think it would also be wise to look into the travel logistics. Knowing the actual time spent moving and waiting would help us choose a destination that doesn't feel too exhausting.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Midori,,"I agree with everyone. To make sure we're all on the same page, I'd really like us to get a clear picture of the total costs upfront so there are no surprises later on.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"It seems we're all in agreement on the priorities. To get a clear picture, we should divide the research. I'll look into the time spent alone in the shared-house and how last year's days actually ran.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"I will look into the all-in rates against meals bought separately, and also what the separately booked rooms cost last time. It would be wonderful to ensure the costs are transparent for everyone.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Minato,,"I'll look into bathing hours and bathroom provision, and also the inn mealtimes and room arrangements. I want to know if we'll have a nice place to sit and relax.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"I'll look into the ferry sailings and train times, as well as getting around by train and bus. I want to see how much of our trip is spent in transit.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Midori,,I'll look into the pricing of offshore houses let whole and the valley inn rates versus urban beds. I want to see how the total costs compare across different options.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,"Since we've divided the tasks, we should be able to cover all the bases. I'm interested to see if there's a pattern in how our schedules affected our mood last year. Does this division work for everyone?","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"It works perfectly for me, dear. I think we have a very thoughtful plan. I look forward to seeing what we all discover so we can make a choice that makes everyone happy.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Minato,,"I think it's a great plan. I'm a little nervous about the rooms, but I'm excited to see what I find out. I hope we can find a place where everyone feels cozy.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,It works for me. I believe having a clear understanding of the transit times will allow us to maximize our actual relaxation once we arrive. I'll report back with the details soon.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Midori,,I'm happy with this arrangement too. I'll do my best to find clear pricing so we can all feel secure about the budget before we decide. I'm looking forward to hearing what you all find!,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,Then it's settled. Let's each gather our information and come back ready to share. I'm looking forward to seeing how these details can help us create the best possible atmosphere for our trip this year.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Shizue,,"I agree completely. Let us all take our time to look into these things carefully. I shall be waiting with a smile to hear what you all find. Safe researching, everyone!","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Minato,,I'll do my best to find everything. I hope the information helps us pick a place where we can all be happy and comfortable. See you all soon!,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,I will begin my research now. I hope the data shows a way for us to spend more time enjoying the destination and less time in transit. I look forward to our next discussion.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Midori,,I'll get started on my research right away. I hope the pricing is straightforward so we can all feel relaxed about the budget. See you all in the next round!,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
