62,3,1,talk,Minato,,I really like Option C. Having my own space and not having to follow a strict schedule for meals or baths would make me feel so much more relaxed and happy.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Jonathan,,"Option C is the most logical choice. It eliminates the risk of losing two days to ferry schedules and avoids the stress of limited bus timings, allowing us to truly relax.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Midori,,"I agree with everyone. As long as we coordinate our hotel choices to keep the costs predictable and fair, Option C is the best way to ensure we all feel comfortable and relaxed.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Mizuki,,"It's rare we're all this aligned. Since we've addressed the budget and space concerns, Option C is clearly the most balanced choice for our group dynamic. I'm ready to vote.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Shizue,,"I am ready as well, dear. It warms my heart to see us all agreeing so kindly. As long as we look after one another's wallets, the city will be a lovely choice.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Minato,,I'm ready to vote too! I feel much better knowing we won't be in one big room or have to worry about cold water. I think we'll all have a wonderful time in the city.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Jonathan,,I am also ready. The efficiency of the city's transport ensures that our holiday is spent on leisure rather than logistics. It is the most restorative path for us all.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Midori,,I'm ready to vote as well. I feel much more secure now that we've discussed how to handle the costs. Let's make this a wonderful and stress-free trip for everyone!,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Mizuki,,"I'll cast my vote for Option C. It's the only choice that solves the tension between being too crowded and being too distant, ensuring we maintain a healthy balance for the whole group.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Shizue,,"I shall also vote for Option C. It is a wonderful compromise that respects everyone's needs, and I trust we will all be very careful to keep the costs fair and transparent.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Minato,,I vote for Option C! I'm so glad we chose this. I can't wait to have a cozy place to sleep and a relaxed schedule where I can just be myself.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Jonathan,,"I vote for Option C. It is the only choice that minimizes the time spent in transit and waiting, ensuring we return home feeling truly refreshed rather than exhausted by the journey.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Midori,,"I vote for Option C. I'm glad we've all found a way to balance our needs, and I'm looking forward to a trip where we can all relax without any budget surprises!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Mizuki,,"It's a unanimous decision. By choosing the city, we've prioritized both our collective bond and our individual well-being. I'm confident this will be our most balanced and refreshing trip yet.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Shizue,,"It truly is a joy to see us all in such harmony. I am certain that by caring for one another, our city trip will be a beautiful and peaceful memory for us all.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,Minato,,I'm so happy we all agree! Thank you for listening to me and making sure I'll be comfortable. I'm really looking forward to our trip to the city with everyone!,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Jonathan,,"I am glad we reached this consensus. By prioritizing efficiency and ease of movement, we have ensured that the journey itself will not overshadow the destination. I look forward to a peaceful trip.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
